        "TileImage": "$($repository c250224d-c3ca-4e06-a7ed-a7f5e28756e7).Image",
        "Description": "From the agents you took out in Sapienza, you found out that your former handler has been promoted. \rAs punishment she was made an assassin and with her lack of training it won&apos;t take long for her to get caught on a mission or fail one and get assassinated by the employer.\rAfter you sold the virus and got rid of your pursuers again, you followed the trail of your handler to Berlin but you arrived late and you are caught between the club security and a biker gang.",
